Hi Sean,

There are two problems; geom_vline needs an xintercept mapping, and
there is a bug that prevents geom_vline from working well with dates.
You can fix these problems as follows:

q + geom_vline(aes(xintercept=as.numeric(V1), colour=version), data=altdf)

Best,
Ista

