Dear ggplot2-users,

i have a plot similar to this:

ggplot(data = NULL, aes(x = 1, y = rnorm(100), col = rnorm(100)<0)) + geom_boxplot() + coord_flip()

and i wonder, whether it is possible to flip the legend-boxplot-symbol as well by 90 degree?

Thanks a lot, Felix

