Felix,

Another way is to control number of columns in legend:

 ggplot(data = NULL, aes(x = 1, y = rnorm(100), col = rnorm(100)>0)) + geom_boxplot() + coord_flip()+guides(col = guide_legend(nrow = 1, byrow = TRUE))

HTH

david

