Hi Michael,

Convert the matrices to data.frames, and use geom_path (or
geom_polygon if you want fill), something like

ggplot(PCA, aes(x=F1, y=F2, colour = Sexe)) +
    geom_point(aes(shape = Sexe), size=3) +

    geom_hline(yintercept = 0) +
    geom_vline(xintercept = 0) +

    geom_path(aes(x=x, y=y),
              data=data.frame(XF, Sexe="F"),
              color="red") +
    geom_path(aes(x=x, y=y),
              data=data.frame(Sexe="H", XH))

Best,
Ista

