But I've lost the apparent relationship between each facet's labels and plotting area. I'd like a set of borders to surround the plotting area and the facet label, like so:

 <https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-7DYPYfq1W4Q/Ul2w1kQTQyI/AAAAAAAAdKs/No9WkKA0Z0k/s1600/facet+border.png>
Is this easy or I do have to write grid code?

