References: <X7pD7LNdY2Y.mistzLFSJVcJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/X7pD7LNdY2Y/m/wy-CJhzgT4sJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi,

You can use this trick,

g = grobTree(textGrob("Hello world!", x=0, hjust=0, y=1, vjust=1))
ggplot(df_dte, aes(x = A, y = B)) + geom_point() + annotation_custom(g)

HTH,

b.

